9 Section 1. W.S. 9-2-1012(e) and 9-2-1013(d)(ii) are
10 amended to read:
11
12 9-2-1012. Duties of the department; transmittal of
13 standard budget and manual; return of completed exception
14 and expanded budgets; submission to governor; disposition
15 of excess general fund appropriations; submission of
1 HB0292

